# Native folders.
#
# /android WAS generated (once, by `expo prebuild --platform android` on 2026-08-21)
# and is now HAND-MAINTAINED, exactly like /ios: it carries the Godot engine embed,
# the passive-entry foreground service and its manifest entries. Never prebuild it
# again — the same clobbering argument below applies to it verbatim.
#
# /ios IS NOT generated either, and treating it as generated was a lie inherited from the Expo
# template. `expo prebuild` would CLOBBER it: the Xcode project carries the
# embedded Godot engine, the share extension target and its entitlements, and
# hand-written Swift that exists nowhere else. It was ignored anyway, so for
# months the only copy of ShareViewController.swift and SharedLocationResolver.swift
# lived on one Mac. Ignore what is genuinely regenerated instead.
#
# The proper fix is a generated project (XcodeGen/Tuist) from a committed spec —
# see docs/ROADMAP.md. This is the pragmatic version of that.
/android/.gradle/
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/local.properties
/android/app/src/main/assets/airgapp.pck
/ios/Pods
/ios/build
/ios/DerivedData
/ios/.xcode.env.local
**/xcuserdata/

# Godot artifacts — produced by export pipeline from /Users/ivan/Work/rpi-filter/tesla-godot/
assets/godot/*.pck
assets/godot/*.a
assets/godot/*.xcframework
assets/godot/*.aar
*.gdc

# Vendored Godot 3.2.2 engine for expo-godot-view (~450 MB of binaries; out of git history).
# Restore per modules/expo-godot-view/ios/VENDORING.md. ** also covers engine/backup-*/ revert copies.
modules/expo-godot-view/ios/engine/**/*.a
modules/expo-godot-view/ios/*.pck
# Vendored Godot Android engine — restore per modules/expo-godot-view/android/VENDORING.md
modules/expo-godot-view/android/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so

# Per-module Gradle build outputs
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.cxx/


# Local-only build artifacts
*.log


# Charger DB build artifacts (pushed to device, not bundled)
scripts/osm/out/

# Gazetteer build artifacts — GeoNames cities1000 → bundled SQLite (build via scripts/geonames/build-places-db.ts)
scripts/geonames/out/
assets/places.db

# generated JSC bundle for the Share Extension (rebuild with npm run build:extension-bundle)
modules/shared-intake/ios/AirgappEngine.js
